    <panel_attributes>title=SD13 Plan a course-bound assistant request
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=AgentController~c
obj=MemoryManager~m
obj=AgentPlanner~p
obj=LLMClient~l
obj=ToolManager~t

u-&gt;f : runAgent(courseId, sessionId, request)
f-&gt;c : handleRequest(courseId, sessionId, request)
c-&gt;m : loadSession(courseId, sessionId)
m.&gt;c : saved course-bound messages
c-&gt;p : createPlan(courseId, request, last ten messages)
p-&gt;l : generate(executionPlanPrompt with actual course context)
l.&gt;p : structured ExecutionPlan
p.&gt;c : plan or clarification
c-&gt;t : validatePlan(plan, results)
t.&gt;c : validation result
c: executePlan(courseId, plan)
c-&gt;m : addMessage(user), addMessage(assistant)
c.&gt;u : AgentResult with session, status, actual outputs and trace
m:Reject foreign or damaged sessions before planning, retain all saved messages</panel_attributes>
